    "text": "newmexicomagazine.org\nwebsite\nTaos\nFind the Weird and Wonderful at Taxonomy\nBy Alison Beckner,\n22 hours agoTaxonomy, in Taos, opens a window into the weird, the wondrous, and the beautifully made. PART SHOP, PART CABINET DE CURIOSITÉ, Taxonomy is rooted in a love of natural history, local creativity, and offbeat charm. Co-owned by Avian and Kyrstin Thorson Rogers, the store just off Taos Plaza reflects the couple’s values and creative instincts.",
